<title>POLAND: Exbud group results for 1996.</title>
<headline>Exbud group results for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exbud preliminary results for financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		20.41   vs   15.64</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		  21.41   vs   18.21</p>
<p>    Group net profit			12.81   vs   12.14</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Exbud SA.</p>
<p>    Group net sales			655.49   vs  414.82</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales		 573.46   vs  360.94</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary loss	     0.10   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    Group income tax			 7.73   vs    6.14</p>
<p>    Group other taxes			0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues	    13.52   vs   15.42</p>
<p>    Group financial costs		 12.74   vs   12.86</p>
<p>    Group investment		     133.23   vs   24.07</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
